  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2024-09-18T14:04:28-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, September 18, 2024, 2:04 pm\">September 18, 2024</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists’ featured artist demonstration at this month’s meeting is <strong>Mary Wojciechowski</strong> working with alcohol ink. The meeting at 2pm in the Harwich Community Center Multi-Purpose Room is free and open to the public. For more information visit Mary’s website: <a href=\"https://www.marywojciechowski-fineart.com/\">Mary Wojciechowski</a>.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7076\" src=\"/media/archive/9e1bac5b406d53ebac21341d10a64bb95a9c8a5b848f2868a7d9917d481a79e0.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"196\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
